。小瓶装水按 1 元 500 毫升算，就是每升 2 元，是自来水的 400 倍。生活饮用水执行的是强制性国家标准 GB 5749-2022。这个标准 2022 年 3 月 15 日发布，2023 年 4 月 1 日起施行。主管部门是国家疾控局（中国，2015 年水价与 2022 年标准）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["北京市发展和改革委员会. 居民用水价格表. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgw.beijing.gov.cn/bmcx/djcx/jzldj/202003/t20200331_1752796.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://fgw.beijing.gov.cn/bmcx/djcx/jzldj/202003/t20200331_1752796.htm"]},"；国家市场监督管理总局 国家标准全文公开系统. GB 5749-2022 生活饮用水卫生标准. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://openstd.samr.gov.cn/bzgk/std/newGbInfo?hcno=99E9C17E3547A3C0CE2FD1FFD9F2F7BE","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://openstd.samr.gov.cn/bzgk/std/newGbInfo?hcno=99E9C17E3547A3C0CE2FD1FFD9F2F7BE"]},"；杭州市联合调查组 (2025). 关于杭州市余杭区部分小区供水异常调查情况通报（2025 年 7 月 23 日），新华网转载 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.news.cn/20250723/1be62dac3b0b4461a643791ff552e93d/c.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.news.cn/20250723/1be62dac3b0b4461a643791ff552e93d/c.html"]},"；杭州市余杭区人民政府. 余杭区 2025 年 4 月／5 月／6 月水源水水质监测数据（杭州余杭水务控股集团公开，检测单位杭州嘉澍环境监测有限公司，附件 PDF 表 1 第 24 项「粪大肠菌群」） ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.yuhang.gov.cn/art/2025/5/8/art_1229204072_59140140.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.yuhang.gov.cn/art/2025/5/8/art_1229204072_59140140.html"]},"、",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.yuhang.gov.cn/art/2025/6/5/art_1229204072_59142885.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.yuhang.gov.cn/art/2025/6/5/art_1229204072_59142885.html"]},"、",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.yuhang.gov.cn/art/2025/7/3/art_1229204072_59146464.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.yuhang.gov.cn/art/2025/7/3/art_1229204072_59146464.html"]},"；公安部网络安全保卫局 (2025). 编造虚假「警情通报」，捏造「粪水」谣言，邵某豪被刑事拘留 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.news.cn/politics/20250722/3178b3bd189c4eb4b293982e92aab438/c.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.news.cn/politics/20250722/3178b3bd189c4eb4b293982e92aab438/c.html"]},"；重庆市市场监督管理局 (2022). 桶装饮用水消费提示（2022 年 10 月 25 日） ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://scjgj.cq.gov.cn/bkzs/spbk/202210/t20221025_11222964.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://scjgj.cq.gov.cn/bkzs/spbk/202210/t20221025_11222964.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgw.beijing.gov.cn/bmcx/djcx/jzldj/202003/t20200331_1752796.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["争议在于，所谓「达标」查的是水厂出来的水和管道末端的水。水源或者管网出问题的时候，会短暂失守。2025 年 7 月 16 日，杭州余杭仁和水厂进的原水气味不对，仁和、良渚部分小区的自来水发臭。官方结论是藻类在缺氧条件下分解，产生了硫醚类物质。换了水源以后，出厂水的总大肠菌群、大肠埃希氏菌都没有检出，全部项目符合生活饮用水标准 GB 5749-2022。事后 7 名干部被问责，7 月水费全免，还免费换了滤芯。但同一个水源的粪大肠菌群，事发前已经连着几个月往上走。苕溪永胜取水口 4 月是 10 个/L，5 月 7300 个/L，6 月 16000 个/L。地表水标准 GB 3838 Ⅲ 类的限值是 10000 个/L。同月四岭水库 28000 个/L、馒头山水库 24000 个/L 也超了。烧开只能杀微生物，除不掉气味物质，也除不掉溶在水里的化学物。闻到异味，或者水发黄发浑，就停下来别喝，向供水企业和 12345 反映，临时改喝瓶装水，别指望多煮几分钟压过去。但这是局部的偶发事故，当地也按次赔了，仍然不构成常年买瓶装水的理由。网上传的「粪水管接错」是伪造的警情通报，发布者已经被刑事拘留（见第 9 节）。桶装水 20 元一桶、瓶装水 1 元 500 毫升都是为了算账设的假设价，你按自己所在城市的实际价格重算。桶装水也不是更干净的那一边：重庆市市场监管局提醒，开封后存得越久微生物污染风险越高，饮水机至少 2 到 3 个月要洗一次。老旧小区的二次供水设施不达标的，可以加装过滤，或者只在这种情况下买水喝。各地水价不同，北京这个数字只用来看个量级。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/05-13"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"在医保 App 上办一次家庭共济绑定，职工医保个人账户的钱就能给配偶、父母、子女看病买药"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/05-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"不频繁交易股票，行情暴涨暴跌的时候更要少动手"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/05-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"chil